{"metadata":{"name":"Sahih Muslim","section":{"11":{"eng-name":"The Book of Prayer - Funerals","ara-name":"كتاب الجنائز"}},"section_detail":{"11":{"hadithnumber_first":2123,"hadithnumber_last":2262,"arabicnumber_first":916.01,"arabicnumber_last":978}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2182,"arabicnumber":"941.04","text":"Rapporté par Abu Salama رضي الله عنه : J’ai demandé à Aïsha رضي الله عنها dans combien de vêtements le Messager d’Allah ﷺ a été enveloppé. Elle a répondu : « Dans trois tissus de Sahul. »","grades":[{"name":"Imam Muslim","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":11,"hadith":60},"chapter":{"id":13,"ara-name":"باب فِي كَفَنِ الْمَيِّتِ ","eng-name":"Shrouding the deceased","isFirstHadith":false}}]}